# Aliya Bibi — Portfolio

Personal portfolio website of Aliya Bibi, a BSCS graduate and aspiring IT professional.  
Showcases projects, skills, experience and contact information.

**Live site:** [https://<username>.github.io/aliya-portfolio/](https://<username>.github.io/aliya-portfolio/)

## Features

- Responsive single-page design (mobile, tablet, desktop)
- Smooth scrolling navigation
- Sections: Home, About, Skills, Projects, Experience, Education, Contact
- Built with HTML, CSS (Bootstrap 5 + custom), and vanilla JavaScript
- Scroll-based reveal animations

## Tech Stack

- HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript
- Bootstrap 5 (CDN)
- Google Fonts (DM Sans, Playfair Display)

## Project Highlight

**IDMUI — Identity Management User Interface for OpenStack Keystone**  
A Flask-based web interface for managing OpenStack Keystone identities via REST APIs, deployed on Ubuntu using Oracle VirtualBox.

- GitHub: [aliyabibi205-sys/idmui-openstack-project](https://github.com/aliyabibi205-sys/idmui-openstack-project)

## How to run locally

1. Clone or download this repository.
2. Open `index.html` in a modern browser.
3. No build step required.

